    "narrative": "As we enter the final stretch of the season, our lineup selection today is dictated by defensive matchups against high-end arms. **Kyle Tucker** headlines the Waves with an elite efficiency score of 64.32; despite a slightly tougher matchup against Ray Kerr, **Kyle Tucker** remains our most reliable asset given his power-speed upside. **Andy Pages** (53.60) and **Jackson Merrill** (49.86) provide moderate support, though both must contend with respectable xERA figures from their respective opponents. **Jackson Merrill** specifically benefits from a dynamic platoon edge (+13%), which keeps his floor stable even though we are wary of the aggressive base-running suppression expected against his opposition.\n\nThe bench decision process was narrow today, with **Dominic Smith** just missing the cut at 32.31. While the optimizer considered his raw projection, the combination of a negative platoon split against Blake Snell and a bottom-tier batting order position suppressed his efficiency below the threshold. We are also managing the absences of **Vladimir Guerrero Jr.** and **Gunnar Henderson**, both of whom are enjoying an off-day, and continuing to monitor **Luis Robert Jr.**, who remains sidelined on the IL. We are proceeding with caution regarding **Drake Baldwin** (45.29) as his lineup position remains pending; should he drop out of the #4 hole, his efficiency score will likely plummet, forcing us to reconsider our catching depth for the day. \n\nWe are not currently deploying secondary options like **Jordan Westburg**, **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.**, **Jacob Wilson**, **Nasim Nunez**, **Heliot Ramos**, **Josh Jung**, **Coby Mayo**, **Miguel Vargas**, **Brayan Rocchio**, **Henry Bolte**, **Curtis Mead**, **Sam Antonacci**, **Franklin Arias**, **Wade Meckler**, **Liam Hicks**, or **Luis Lara**, as their situational metrics did not outweigh our current starters. Keep a close eye on the confirmed lineups for **Drake Baldwin**, **Kyle Tucker**, and **Andy Pages**; any shift in their proximity to the middle of the order against these starters could drastically impact our 5x5 Roto output.",
